      "kind": "theorem",
      "type": "∀ {R : Type u_3} {S : Type u_4} [inst : CommRing S] [inst_1 : PartialOrder S] [IsOrderedRing S] [NoZeroDivisors S]\n  [inst_4 : Ring R] (abv : R → S) [IsAbsoluteValue abv] (a : R), abv (-a) = abv a"
